  (text "BATTERY INPUT PROTECTION (2S LiPo / 6xAA)\nLTC4365 + back-to-back NMOS: reverse to -40V, OV trip 9.7V, UV trip 6.1V\nF1 3A PTC: short / stall protection.  D1 bidirectional TVS: spikes only.\nSW1 = power switch (pulls ~SHDN low = OFF, carries uA only)"
    (at 25.4 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e50b40d3-6ebd-4f36-992b-786a06a43d8b")
  )
  (text "USB-C 5V INPUT: 1.1A PTC (protects the host port), 5V TVS,\nSS34 Schottky stops the battery back-feeding the USB host"
    (at 25.4 151.13 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8024716d-abe7-43da-a13f-a101bb6d50d5")
  )
  (text "BUCK REGULATORS from VSYS (4.6-9.7V)\nU2 AP63203: 3V3 2A (ESP32, logic)   U3 AP63205: 5V 2A (speaker amp)"
    (at 195.58 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5713f267-7e5f-4078-8edb-9021dc06a141")
  )
